---
import '@fontsource/rajdhani/500.css';
import '@fontsource/rajdhani/700.css';
import '@fontsource/inter/400.css';
import '@fontsource/inter/600.css';
import '@fontsource/share-tech-mono';
import '../styles/global.css';
import {site,sections,url} from '../config';
import Discord from '../components/Discord.astro';
interface Props { title?:string; description?:string; active?:string; noindex?:boolean; }
const {title='NIGHT CITY. MORE STORIES.',description=site.description,active='',noindex=false}=Astro.props;
const canonical=new URL(Astro.url.pathname,Astro.site);
---
<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#071525"/><title>{title} | KiroshiRP</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/>{noindex && <meta name="robots" content="noindex"/>}<meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:title" content={`${title} | KiroshiRP`}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:image" content={new URL(url('images/kiroshi-original.jpg'),Astro.site)}/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><link rel="icon" href={url('favicon.svg')}/></head>
<body><a class="skip" href="#contenido">Saltar al contenido</a><header class="site-header"><a class="wordmark" href={url()} aria-label="KiroshiRP, inicio"><span class="eye" aria-hidden="true">◉</span><span>KIROSHI<small>ROLEPLAY</small></span></a><button class="menu-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navigation">MENÚ ☰</button><nav id="navigation" aria-label="Principal"><a href={url()} aria-current={active==='inicio'?'page':undefined}>Inicio</a>{sections.map(s=><a href={url(`${s.id}/`)} aria-current={active===s.id?'page':undefined}>{s.title}</a>)}<Discord/></nav><a class="search-toggle" href={url('buscar/')} aria-label="Buscar en el archivo">⌕</a></header>
<main id="contenido"><slot/></main>
<footer><div class="footer-top"><a class="wordmark" href={url()}>KIROSHIRP<small>NIGHT CITY. MORE STORIES.</small></a><span class="mono">SAME CITY. DIFFERENT PEOPLE.</span></div><div class="footer-links"><a href={url()}>Inicio</a>{sections.map(s=><a href={url(`${s.id}/`)}>{s.title}</a>)}<a href={site.discord || url('contacto/')}>Discord</a><a href={url('contacto/')}>Contacto</a><a href={url('aviso-legal/')}>Aviso legal</a><a href={url('privacidad/')}>Política de privacidad</a></div><p>KiroshiRP es un proyecto independiente de la comunidad, ambientado en el universo de Cyberpunk 2077. No está afiliado oficialmente a CD PROJEKT RED ni a OPEN//77.</p><p class="fine">Cyberpunk 2077 y sus elementos pertenecen a sus respectivos titulares. Imagen de marca facilitada por KiroshiRP. Archivo público · Sin cuentas de usuario.</p></footer>
<script>
 const toggle=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.menu-toggle'); const nav=document.querySelector('nav');
 toggle?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=toggle.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));nav?.classList.toggle('open',open)});
 document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){toggle?.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');nav?.classList.remove('open');toggle?.focus()}});
 window.addEventListener('scroll',()=>document.querySelector('header')?.classList.toggle('scrolled',window.scrollY>30),{passive:true});
</script></body></html>
